#: ../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v032/ANet/docs/agents/index.rst:67
msgid ""
"ANet does not support Windows. The steps of every page were verified on "
"Linux; each page lists what was not tested on macOS and in the graphical "
"clients. The command ``anet agents wire --all`` registers every tool of "
"the table that it detects and leaves the others unchanged."
msgstr ""
"ANet 不支持 Windows。各页的步骤均在 Linux 上验证；各页列出了在 macOS 和图形客户端上未经测试的内容。命令 ``anet "
"agents wire --all`` 登记表中所有检测到的工具，其余工具保持不变。"

